{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09034","headline":"西郊养疾闻畅校书有新什见赠久伫不至先寄此诗 · 韦应物","name":"西郊养疾闻畅校书有新什见赠久伫不至先寄此诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"养病惬清夏，郊园敷卉木。\n牕夕含涧凉，雨余爱筠绿。\n披怀始高咏，对琴转幽独。\n仰子游羣英，吐词如兰馥。\n还闻枉嘉藻，伫望延昏旭。\n唯见草青青，闭户沣水曲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09034.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09034","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}